blurb = "Depicts Nurarihyon (\"slippery gourd\"), a yōkai with a gourd-shaped head said to sneak into wealthy houses and indulge in a household's fine goods. Later interpretations relabeled him as the leader of the yōkai, which was likely the result of a depiction in a 1929 book by Morihiko Fujisawa."
